We have $x=t^{2}-1$ and $y=t^{2}-t \begin{array}{l}
\therefore\frac{\mathrm{dx}}{\mathrm{dt}}=2 \mathrm{t} \text{ and } \frac{\mathrm{dy}}{\mathrm{dt}}=2 \mathrm{t}-1 \\
